### Day 16: Ticket Service Refactor Regression Test
### Run Spring Boot first: .\mvnw spring-boot:run

### Login (adjust email/password to your seeded support-desk user)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}


### Copy token from login response
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhZG1pbkBleGFtcGxlLmNvbSIsInJvbGUiOiJBRE1JTiIsImlzcyI6InN1cHBvcnQtZGVzay1hcGkiLCJuYW1lIjoiQWRtaW4gVXNlciIsImV4cCI6MTc4NjcyMjM1NSwiaWF0IjoxNzg2NzE4NzU1LCJ1c2VySWQiOiI2YTYyMmUxZTJiYTFkYjcxN2QyMWUwYTIifQ.yCtwzOzKS5gUd5W1dD_lQCJ464c5gIpd0VMHnzYdR7Y


### Create a new ticket - should return 201 with status OPEN
POST http://localhost:8081/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Day16 Regression Check Ticket",
  "description": "Verifying TicketService still creates tickets correctly after the refactor.",
  "category": "Software",
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "createdBy": "muna@example.com"
}


### Create with the same title again - should return 409 (duplicate check still works)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Day16 Regression Check Ticket",
  "description": "This title already exists and should be rejected.",
  "category": "Software",
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "createdBy": "muna@example.com"
}


### Get all tickets and copy one id below - should return 200
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Get by a valid id - should return 200
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tickets/6a60af167d65ebee03480705
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Get by a non-existent id - should return 404 (findTicketOrThrow still works)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tickets/000000000000000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Update a valid ticket - should return 200 with updated fields
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/tickets/6a60af167d65ebee03480705
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Day16 Regression Check Ticket (Updated)",
  "description": "Verifying TicketService still updates tickets correctly after the refactor.",
  "category": "Software",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}


### Update a non-existent id - should return 404 (same findTicketOrThrow path as GET)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/tickets/000000000000000000000000
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Should not matter",
  "description": "Should not matter",
  "category": "Software",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}


### Paged tickets ascending - should return 200, sorted by title A-Z
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tickets/paged?page=0&size=5&sortBy=title&direction=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Paged tickets descending - should return 200, sorted by title Z-A
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tickets/paged?page=0&size=5&sortBy=title&direction=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Register a throwaway non-admin user (self-registration always assigns USER)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Regular User",
  "email": "regularuser@example.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}


### Copy the token from the register response above
@userToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJyZWd1bGFydXNlckBleGFtcGxlLmNvbSIsInJvbGUiOiJVU0VSIiwiaXNzIjoic3VwcG9ydC1kZXNrLWFwaSIsIm5hbWUiOiJSZWd1bGFyIFVzZXIiLCJleHAiOjE3ODY3MjYyNDIsImlhdCI6MTc4NjcyMjY0MiwidXNlcklkIjoiNmE3ZjM5NTIzMjM1MzI2OTg2YjRlYjQyIn0.SGIwLp-Hw_fAOEODkI8yHNktx4yzEFlGWqBfZWCF_qw


### Non-admin attempting to create a ticket - should return 403 (POST is hasRole ADMIN only)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

{
  "title": "Should be forbidden",
  "description": "Non-admin users cannot create tickets per SecurityConfig",
  "category": "Software",
  "priority": "LOW",
  "createdBy": "regularuser@example.com"
}